# Pylance Extra Paths
RULE: Use python.analysis.extraPaths in .vscode/settings.json for local package resolution — not pyproject.toml.
WHY: Centralizes IDE config; resolves unified_trading_services etc.; no "Unresolved import" squiggles.
CODEX: .cursor/workspace-configs/, .cursor/rules/pylance-extra-paths.mdc
DO: extraPaths: ["${workspaceFolder}/unified-trading-library", ...]; autoSearchPaths: true
NEVER: Rely on [tool.pyright] in pyproject for import resolution; fragment config across repos
